{"version":1,"content":"<p>《璀璨之城》演員張曦雯（Kelly）、吳卓羲、陳瀅、高海寧和監製陳維冠等，今天（25日）出席劇集宣傳活動，該劇由拍攝至播出是非不絕，不只監製陳維冠特地為此親自解釋因由，陳瀅、高海寧及張曦雯同樣為劇中因何要性感演出解畫，吳卓羲亦為緋聞女友Kelly護航。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.314587+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T12:09:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:06.564722+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536855+00:00","content_hash":"cd0b060184970e6d5e8cacc3bc5261cf22379d91fbe0ac9234433ef58a32ac8f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}